\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/commit-habits-consistency/id1659811306\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":3.9,\"ratingCount\":10,\"ratingCountList\":[1,1,1,2,5],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"3.9 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Commit: Habits \u0026 Consistency\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"Aidar Nugmanov\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.0 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 15.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"12.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"VISUALIZE YOUR PROGRESS\\nElegantly designed grid enables you to focus on the big picture and see the power of consistency and compounding.\\nIt allows you to don't feel the added pressure of following the streaks.\\n\\nCOMMIT TO HABITS\\nYou commit yourself for the change by creating the new habit with configurable regularity that suits you.\\n\\nCONTROL YOUR HISTORY\\nToggling completion of the given habit is allowed both for the current day and the days in the past.\\n\\nFEELINGS OVER FIGURES\\nWe believe that stats and dates are not important.\\nWhat important is how you feel, that's why by default app operates in mode with minimum visual elements.\\n\\nCALENDAR VIEW\\nFor those who feels more comfortable seeing the picture spread across the months and dates \\nwe provide the feature to reveal just what's needed to be shown in the form of calendar view.\\n\\nDELIGHTFUL INTERACTIVITY\\nSnappy feedback and fluidity of the interfaces makes navigating and using it feel like a breeze.\\n\\nNEED HELP?\\nSupport: https://www.trycommit.app/support\\nTerms of Use: https://www.trycommit.app/terms\\nPrivacy Policy:  https://www.trycommit.app/privacy\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"websiteUrl\":\"https://trycommit.app/\",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have added notifications to help you stay committed to your habits! \\n\\nNotifications could be sent twice a day: one in the morning and one in the evening. You can always manage your preferences on the Settings page.\\n\\nBest regards,\\nCommit team\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-02-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-02-16T13:59:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-25T20:08:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-12T21:31:23Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-03T17:52:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2023.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-02T12:50:53Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"2022.12.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"It's time to set goals for the new year. Commit yourself to the next year by creating habits and sharing with friends on your favorite social networks!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-30\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-30T21:22:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We keep making Commit better so that you are one commit closer to better version of yourself.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-28T08:20:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-26T05:43:02Z\"}],\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1659811306\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=854929292\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":13522944}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1659811306\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=854929292\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":13522944}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-25\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"app.commit\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/02/38/19/023819f3-f016-b5b8-ca5c-a83b0d5725fe/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-6-0-85-220.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0d1116\",\"textColor1\":\"3feb5c\",\"textColor2\":\"41d55c\",\"textColor3\":\"35bf4e\",\"textColor4\":\"37ad4e\"},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://trycommit.app/privacy\",\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://trycommit.app/support\",\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"width\":1080,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features114/v4/0d/d9/6c/0dd96cca-2fb0-2ff7-eeb4-204c1dd54bcc/pr_source.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"}},\"subtitle\":\"Daily Goal Tracker\",\"customAttributes\":{\"default\":{\"default\":{\"customPromotionalText\":\"Build habits that last, not streaks that fade. Focus on the big picture. Set and achieve your long-term goals without the added pressure of maintaining a streak.\",\"customScreenshotsByType\":{\"iphone_6_5\":[{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2688,\"url\":\"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource123/v4/e3/05/b2/e305b275-effb-e135-75cc-c7e2cb2899c2/38ed3424-bc94-4eaf-baee-6c8c3ea660c1_65-1.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0e1116\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"79e970\",\"textColor3\":\"cecfd0\",\"textColor4\":\"63be5e\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2688,\"url\":\"https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource113/v4/5b/eb/81/5beb81a6-70d0-cc77-c44f-1adf9041d399/a12f8042-0d90-4e19-b619-dc12aacb3c25_65-2.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"171b21\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"79e970\",\"textColor3\":\"d0d1d2\",\"textColor4\":\"65c060\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2688,\"url\":\"https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource113/v4/be/f7/7e/bef77eb0-e7aa-8f60-a551-134e920653b5/f1744d6a-c699-418c-a36f-ea0e61cf6811_65-3.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0e1116\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"cdced1\",\"textColor3\":\"cecfd0\",\"textColor4\":\"a6a8ab\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2688,\"url\":\"https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource113/v4/83/3d/25/833d25ae-009b-c015-5895-f6c47f774c69/c5a2cb8d-d020-4e5e-a7bc-f832adfc038a_65-4.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"171b21\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"cccfd3\",\"textColor3\":\"d0d1d2\",\"textColor4\":\"a8abaf\"}],\"iphone6+\":[{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource113/v4/81/d9/18/81d91845-a43c-0b4d-d1cf-7a6ca0b5e7c0/65791d02-0496-4aae-9bd1-810e543f59a3_55-1.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"0e1116\",\"textColor1\":\"f0f0f1\",\"textColor2\":\"79e970\",\"textColor3\":\"c3c4c5\",\"textColor4\":\"63be5e\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource123/v4/6c/13/1e/6c131ee8-8812-16a3-65e3-5dc192237075/ba859870-3926-4d56-a6f1-b7e48df18789_55-2.png/{w}x{h}{c}.