"4b4141\"},{\"width\":1440,\"height\":900,\"url\":\"https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple122/v4/82/72/5a/82725aac-ec33-3372-8670-a2f0fde60a8e/f9fbb0f1-f1de-4b8b-8c73-d55455778e06_Screen_Shot_2021-07-28_at_10.28.09_AM.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"c3baba\",\"textColor1\":\"0a0a0b\",\"textColor2\":\"111010\",\"textColor3\":\"2f2d2e\",\"textColor4\":\"343232\"}]}}}}},\"ios\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Pinstachio is a simple and modern Pinboard app for your iPhone and iPad. Read and manage all of your saved bookmarks with ease!\\n\\nAs a free app, Pinstachio will allow you to easily read your existing bookmarks and even filter unread ones. Try using it for your read-later lists!\\n\\nIf you choose to upgrade to Pinstachio+, you will unlock all of its features including:\\n\\n+ Adding new bookmarks, including via the share extension\\n+ Editing and managing all of your bookmarks\\n+ More filtering options, including by tags\\n+ Cosmetic features, including new app icons and app tints\\n\\nAlso has other features you've come to expect from iOS and iPadOS like:\\n\\n+ Dark mode support\\n+ Link previews\\n+ Multitasking support with split screen or slide over\\n+ Widgets for showing random unread articles from your collection\\n+ Compatible with Quick Notes in iPadOS\\n\\nIf you are a Pinboard user, please consider trying Pinstachio out today!\\n\\n---\\n\\nQuestions? Email support@pinstachio.com\\n\\npinstach.io/privacy\\npinstach.io/terms\\n\\n---\\n\\n* Please note that Pinstachio requires a Pinboard account to work.\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Bug fixes, including one with the tag view\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-01-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-01-15T12:00:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Fixes some bugs, including some with \\\"Mark As Read\\\" settings\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-02T21:22:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Fixes a crash for a small number of users in 1.7.1\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-11-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-11-14T11:03:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Bug fixes and other small improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-10-28T00:06:56Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added an option to show preview images for bookmarks on the main screen\\n+ Added an option to hide the accessory button to save space\\n+ Added an advanced option for stripping UTM tracking from URLs fetched by the share extension\\n+ Added new minimalist icons\\n+ The bookmark visibility icon now only shows up as a lock on the bookmark's details label if it's set as private\\n+ iOS 15 or later: the tags filtering view is now presented as a draggable sheet on smaller screens\\n+ Bug fixes and other minor improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-10-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-10-16T18:07:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added support for Lock Screen widgets\\n+ Other behind-the-scenes improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-09-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-09-12T11:06:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added support for multiple windows of the app in iPadOS\\n+ Added a shortcut for saving bookmarks into a Pinboard account using Pinstachio\\n+ Organized the settings screen into Behavior and Appearance sections for a cleaner look\\n+ Added a setting that allows disabling the option of the keyboard automatically appearing when opening the tags view (found in Settings \u003e Behavior \u003e Keyboard)\\n+ Other minor bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-06-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-06-20T21:01:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added a setting to enable double-tapping a bookmark to trigger the secondary button's configured action\\n+ Other bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-05-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-05-09T11:23:24Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added option to hide visibility icon from list (public or private)\\n+ Added option to fit preview image within its constraints instead of filling\\n+ Search now also tries to match any query with bookmarks' tags\\n+ Usual line of bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-04-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-04-10T15:20:29Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added setting to show last-used tags in the tags view for easy access if you use them consecutively\\n+ Added setting to pick whether to show a bookmark's details or the website when accessing from the widget\\n+ Other minor improvements and bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-13\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-13T18:39:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Fixes a crash when searching in the iPad version\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-04T22:41:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added support for iOS/iPadOS 15 and Quick Notes\\n+ Added a setting to personalize tap actions on the main screen\\n+ Other minor improvements and bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-09-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-09-20T15:09:07Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added setting to show unread bookmarks on launch\\n+ Added setting to automatically have the in-app Safari browser show bookmarks in reader mode, if available\\n+ Added setting to choose new larger image preview options\\n+ Image preview now hides if there is none available\\n+ Search now also returns results from inside bookmarks' description text\\n+ Other minor improvements and bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-14T11:51:29Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Many improvements under the hood as a result of the new Mac version of the app -- now available in the Mac App Store! And stay tuned for more new features!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-02T23:45:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.11\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-10T18:20:13Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.10\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Bug fixes and improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-04-17\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-04-17T01:27:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.9\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added community feeds browser for popular and a few others\\n+ Bigger and faster image previews for bookmarks\\n+ Tapping a tag on the main screen will now filter for it\\n+ Other small improvements and bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-03-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-03-07T18:42:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added option to show bookmarks' descriptions on the main screen\\n+ Added background refresh functionality to keep bookmarks always up to date\\n+ Added advanced options to tweak app performance around bookmark fetching\\n+ Several improvements and bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-02-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-02-20T13:38:50Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ New tags picker view with smarter autofill\\n+ New default icon and variants\\n+ Bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-31\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-31T15:21:12Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added option to show/hide tags in the main bookmarks view\\n+ Added option to detect URLs from clipboard to create new bookmarks\\n+ Added an option to disable animations\\n+ More performance improvements and bug fixes\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-28T11:35:21Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.5\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added details field to bookmark view\\n+ Speed and stability improvements\\n+ Added three new alternate icons\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-01-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-01-18T00:44:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Added small bookmark previews as an option\\n+ Added a search bar for the tags view\\n+ Now prompts to save bookmark changes\\n+ Improved performance around bookmark deletion\\n+ Other performance improvements and bug squashing\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-12-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-12-29T23:54:12Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Adds setting for disabling refresh on app start\\n+ Some optimizations for how the app refreshes from the Pinboard API\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-12-11\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-12-11T18:57:19Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Fixes a crash on iPad\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-12-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-12-02T01:24:00Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"+ Includes a new option to share bookmarks using iOS's share sheet\\n+ Bug fixes, including those around the subscription experience\",\"releaseDate\":\"2020-12-01\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2020-12-01T13:46:08Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://pinstachio.com\",\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1535386074\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=854371841\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":31611904}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1535386074\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=854371841\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":31611904}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2020-11-24\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.fracbits.Pinstachio\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thum