TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"The following data may be collected but it is not linked to your identity:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnostics\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"4+\",\"value\":100,\"rank\":1}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"mac\",\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/pasteline-add-a-note-quickly/id1531468796\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":5,\"ratingCount\":5,\"ratingCountList\":[0,0,0,0,5],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"5.0 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Productivity\",\"name\":\"Pasteline – Add a Note Quickly\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"Tapteek\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires macOS 10.15 or later.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 14.1 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 14.1 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"osx\":{\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Pasteline: The Ultimate Note-Taking App for Individuals and Teams\\n\\nAre you tired of using complicated note-taking apps just to jot down a quick note? Do you find it difficult to locate notes you've previously saved? If so, consider giving Pasteline a try.\\n\\nWith Pasteline, you can quickly and easily save small notes in a text message format, with each note being stored as a separate message. It's intuitive and easy-to-use, making it the perfect app for taking quick notes.\\n\\nCapture your ideas when inspiration strikes. Save notes and links anywhere and view them later in an inbox folder to deal with distractions and accomplish more - at work, at home, and everywhere in between.\\n\\nPasteline can be used individually or as a team, at home or at work (or anywhere!). With automatic synchronization, your data is always up-to-date on any device. Pasteline will give any team superpowers!\\n\\nKEY FEATURES\\n\\nQuick and easy note-taking\\nPasteline makes it easy to add notes, links, and ideas. Creating a note is as simple as sending a text message on your favorite messaging app. Just tap the Paste button to save your clipboard information as a note.\\n\\nSmart Folders\\nIf you're unsure where to save a note, simply add it to the Inbox folder. All your notes, links, and YouTube videos are stored in the same folders, making it easy to access your recent notes quickly.\\n\\nCollaborative Features\\nShare a folder with your friends or colleagues and create a list of your favorite movies, games, or places together, no matter the distance.\\n\\nWhy use Pasteline?\\n\\n- Simple and minimal interface\\n- Quickly search for notes from anywhere.\\n- Sync your notes between your iPhone, iPad, and Mac.\\n- One in-app subscription works on all your devices.\\n- Create shared note folders for collaboration.\\n\\nPasteline is already an excellent time-saving solution, and we're constantly working to improve and enhance the app. We're excited to introduce even more amazing features in the future.\\n\\nPasteline is available for Mac OS and iOS, and it's free to download.\\n\\nIf you have any questions, please don't hesitate to get in touch with us.\\n\\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update contains improvements and bug fixes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-05T16:04:59Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"We have improved data sync\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-09T06:52:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Hey there!\\nIn this update we've added some great new features:\\n• The Quick Note window lets you save note to Pasteline from anywhere without having to switch applications. \\nUse the keyboard shortcuts ⌃ + ⌘ + V to make the window appear.\\n• Pasteline icon in menu bar lets you save note to Pasteline from clipboard without having to switch applications. \\n\\nCheck out our YouTube channel to see how it works.\\n\\n–––\\n\\nPasteline is also available for iOS.\\n\\nWe hope you enjoy Pasteline. Would you mind taking a moment to write a nice review? We'd greatly appreciate it. Thanks for using Pasteline! :)\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-12-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-12-04T08:12:31Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-26T06:22:59Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://tapteek.com\",\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1531468796\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=855294613\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":4230737}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1531468796\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=855294613\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"$0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"USD\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"macSoftware\",\"size\":4230737}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-25\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.tapteek.pasteline\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/22/ad/0e/22ad0e54-e022-cc0d-8caf-a9f7afbbb8aa/AppIcon-85-220-0-3-2x.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"1da0ff\",\"textColor3\":\"cbcbcb\",\"textColor4\":\"1780cb\"},\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://tapteek