olders, making it easy to access your recent notes quickly.\\n\\nCollaborative Features\\nShare a folder with your friends or colleagues and create a list of your favorite movies, games, or places together, no matter the distance.\\n\\nWhy use Pasteline?\\n\\n- Simple and minimal interface\\n- Quickly search for notes from anywhere.\\n- Sync your notes between your iPhone, iPad, and Mac.\\n- One in-app subscription works on all your devices.\\n- Create shared note folders for collaboration.\\n\\nPasteline is already an excellent time-saving solution, and we're constantly working to improve and enhance the app. We're excited to introduce even more amazing features in the future.\\n\\nPasteline is available for Mac OS and iOS, and it's free to download.\\n\\nIf you have any questions, please don't hesitate to get in touch with us.\\n\\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"This update contains improvements and bug fixes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-03-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-03-05T18:21:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Added the ability to share from other apps.\\n\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-12-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-12-08T16:01:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Hey there!\\nThis small update fixes a bug with scrolling long text in the add note field.\\n\\n–––\\n\\nPasteline is also available for MacOS.\\n\\nWe hope you enjoy Pasteline. Would you mind taking a moment to write a nice review? We'd greatly appreciate it. Thanks for using Pasteline! :)\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-11-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-11-21T08:00:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-10-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-10-26T06:22:44Z\"}],\"websiteUrl\":\"https://tapteek.com\",\"messagesScreenshots\"